W1 finding 2 (hypothesis): GLib also accepts an option of a named
GOptionGroup as --<prefix>-<option>, where <prefix> is any prefix of the group
name. port belongs to the group "connectiongroup", so "conn-port=3307" in a
config file sets the port: mydumper tries port 3307, where nothing listens,
and fails to connect. Without the alias it would be an unknown option (fatal
or ignored, F6), never a connection to 3307.
-- scenario --
tool: mydumper
versions: >= v0.19.1-1
args: --defaults-file /work/mydumper.cnf --host mysql --user e2e --password e2e-password --database app
lint:
expect config-loaded: true
expect exit: nonzero
expect stderr-lacks: Unknown option
expect stderr-contains: 3307
expect connected: false
-- mydumper.cnf --
[mydumper]
conn-port=3307
